:00:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yaşam.Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:25.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Veda ya da yaşam?Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yaşam.Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:48.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Veda ya da yaşam?Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:38.27,Author,,0,0,0,, Türkçeleştirme & Çevirmen   onepacetr.net - ARE-YOU-SURE thx to onepace.netDialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:59.80,Author,,0,0,0,, Türkçeleştirme & Çevirmen   onepacetr.net - ARE-YOU-SURE thx to onepace.netDialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:12.10,Author,,0,0,0,, Türkçeleştirme & Çevirmen   onepacetr.net - ARE-YOU-SURE thx to onepace.netDialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:38.27,Title,,0,0,0,,Lola'nın Vivre KartıDialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Çoğalmışlar ve hayvan gibi debeleniyorlar!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:42.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ayartan OrmanDialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Size ne oldu böyle?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hiçbiriniz gerçek değil misiniz?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:56.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Çöz beni be!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,İnsan gibi konuşuyor!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Gerçeğim ben!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Dinle! Seni arıyordum ben de!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Nasıl birden bağlarsın beni?Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Ö... Özür dieim...Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ama çok şaşırdım. Neler oluyor böyle?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten de bana benziyor.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Gerçek olanlar bunlar arasında olsa daha kolay olurdu.Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Çoğaldığınızı düşündüm.Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Çoğalmadık be! Yani biraz öyle ama...Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Baksana sen!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Bir şey biliyorsun değil mi?Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,O kadın tarafından saldırıya uğradığımızda bile buradaydın.Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Hiçbir şey görmedim.Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, ne oldu?Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Senin tarafından saldırıya uğradım Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Ben mi?Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Daha doğrusu sen sanıp kaçmaya çalıştığımız sahte olandı.Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Ne demek istiyorsun?Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:20.74,Main,,0,0,0,,O Luffy birden dev bir kadına dönüşüp bize saldırdı.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:28.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Bırak beni!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sen de kimsin-teia?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée'yim!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée?Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:41.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Tatlı bir tavşan ve tatlı bir kız. Ne güzel.Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Böyle güzel yüzleri görünce...Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,...parçalayasım geliyor!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:51.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yapma!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:55.52,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Luffy nerede?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:58.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Bilmem ki.Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Ormanda dolanıyordur eminim.Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Clima-Tact!Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.54,Attack,,0,0,0,,İklim Aygıtı!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, iyi misin?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Evet, ucuz kurtuldum.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Teşekkürler Usopp.Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Ne küstahlık.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Bana bırakın!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.78,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.78,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.78,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:47.04,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,m 30 23 b 24 23 24 33 30 33 b 36 33 37 23 30 23 m 35 27 l 60 28 l 35 29 m 26 27 l 0 28 l 26 29 m 29 23 l 30 0 l 31 23 m 29 33 l 30 56 l 31 33Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:47.24,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:47.23,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,m 30 23 b 24 23 24 33 30 33 b 36 33 37 23 30 23 m 35 27 l 60 28 l 35 29 m 26 27 l 0 28 l 26 29 m 29 23 l 30 0 l 31 23 m 29 33 l 30 56 l 31 33Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:47.43,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,leDialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:47.42,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,m 30 23 b 24 23 24 33 30 33 b 36 33 37 23 30 23 m 35 27 l