gue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:36.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Çok fazlalar! Üçümüz de yakalanırsak işimiz biter!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:42.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Yonkou'nun adamları bunlar! Daha dikkatli olmalıyız!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:45.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Gidip Luffy'yi ara! Ben burada yapabileceğimi yaparım!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:49.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır, geri döneceğim!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:52.66,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,RumDialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:52.89,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,ble!Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.66,0:09:52.89,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,RumDialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:52.94,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:52.94,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:52.94,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:52.94,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 